# Insatiable Avarice, spree: the "+ {B}{B}" mode alone costs {B}{B}{B}, and "Target player draws three cards and loses 3 life" may target
# any player. Bot1 targets Bot2 on turn 1 with a Black Lotus: Bot2 draws three cards (life loss is not damage and costs nothing else) and
# loses 3 life (CR 121.1, 119.3). Bot1 itself draws nothing and loses nothing, and does not search (that mode was not chosen): its library keeps its order, the Lightning Bolt third, as no search shuffled it.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Insatiable Avarice
Swamp x5
Swamp x2
Lightning Bolt
Swamp x7

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Insatiable Avarice.Cast
Bot1.Modes(2)
Bot1.Target(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Turn = 1
Bot2.Life = 17
Bot2.Hand.Count = 10
Bot2.Library.Count = 10
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot1.Hand.Count = 5
Bot1.Library.Count = 10
Bot1.Library = Swamp; Swamp; Lightning Bolt; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp
Bot1.Graveyard = Insatiable Avarice; Black Lotus
